---
import { SITE } from '../utils/site';
---

<footer class="bg-zone-footer text-slate-300 mt-16 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 via-cyan-500 to-violet-500 text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-md">
            梯
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-white font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight">{SITE.name}</div>
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-300 font-semibold">{SITE.enName} · {SITE.domain}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 max-w-md">
          梯子大全（{SITE.domain}）为独立网络知识百科站点，专注于多设备与操作系统配置教程、AI 与流媒体网络知识、新手基础概念、隐私安全及常见连接排障。本站非任何机场品牌官方网站，不发布虚假测速报告或虚构使用体验。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1 text-slate-300">HTML lang="zh-CN"</span>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1 text-slate-300">资料基准日期：2026-11-25</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">核心知识栏目</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/devices/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">设备与系统教程中心</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ai/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">AI 工具网络知识</a></li>
          <li><a href="/streaming/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">流媒体网络知识</a></li>
          <li><a href="/beginners/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">新手入门百科全书</a></li>
          <li><a href="/troubleshooting/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">网络故障排查中心</a></li>
          <li><a href="/safety/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">安全与隐私保护中心</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">品牌与对比工具</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/brands/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">18 家机场品牌目录</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tools/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">网络工具与协议百科</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tools/vpn-and-proxy/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">VPN 与机场代理对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/comparison/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">机场横向对比数据库</a></li>
          <li><a href="/comparison/methodology/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">机场横向对比与评分标准</a></li>
          <li><a href="/articles/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">全部深度文章索引</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">站点规范与披露</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/about/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">关于梯子大全</a></li>
          <li><a href="/editorial-policy/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">编辑规范与资料来源</a></li>
          <li><a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">推广链接与商业披露</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">隐私声明</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">联系与资料纠错</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap.xml" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">Sitemap 站点地图</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800/90 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <p>© 2026 {SITE.name} ({SITE.enName}) · {SITE.url} · 历史套餐价格与政策以各品牌官网实时结算页为准。</p>
      <p>纠错联系：{SITE.contactEmail}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
